{"path":"\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/' data-target='root' data-title=''>&#8962; <\/a>\r\n\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer' data-target='computer' data-title='Computer'>\r\n\t\t\tComputer\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/os' data-target='computer\/os' data-title='OS'>\r\n\t\t\tOS\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/os\/android' data-target='computer\/os\/android' data-title='Android'>\r\n\t\t\tAndroid\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n","async":"0","desc":"Unlock the bootloader from FastBoot, then install SuperUser from recovery.","label":"Rooting","prevArticle":{"id":"computer\/os\/android\/notes","label":"Android notes","url":"\/computer\/os\/android\/notes"},"nextArticle":{"id":"computer\/os\/android\/hibernate_and_freeze","label":"Hibernate & Freeze","url":"\/computer\/os\/android\/hibernate_and_freeze"},"languageSwitcher":"<div id='language-switcher'>\n<\/div>\n","content":"<div id='message'>\n\t<p>\n\t\tCaution: unlocking the bootloader and installing SuperUser replaces system recovery state.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Unlock bootloader<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\tBoot in the FastBoot menu and run the unlock command.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<ul class=\"list-bullet content-list\">\n\t\t<li><div>Booting will show an unlocked padlock.<\/div><\/li>\n\t\t<li><div>In the FastBoot menu, lock status will be Unlocked.<\/div><\/li>\n\t<\/ul>\n\t<h2>Install SuperUser<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\tIn the FastBoot menu, place the zip on the SDCard, then install the zip from recovery mode.\n\t<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n<div id='updated-container'>\r\n\t<div id='updated'>\r\n\t\tUpdated:\r\n\t\t<span id='date'>\r\n\t\t\t2026 Aug 19\t\t<\/span>\r\n\t<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div class='center' id='content-body-separator'><\/div>\r\n<div id='sub-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n<\/div>\r